      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">The first of your line was of an Eronkhai born from the ashes mixed with Azoph-met’s blood and rib, and you are born with their features. You bear a humanoid form of stout build, just shy of a sapien’s height with coarse skin and sharp, piercing eyes. You are one among many, varied and ambitious – perfectly sculpted to go forth and become part of the Cosmic Balance. You gain a 1st level class feat of your choice.</span></p>"
